===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*jumala}}, from {{der|fi|urj-fpr-pro|*juma||sky, god}}, probably borrowed from {{der|fi|iir-pro|*dyumā}} (compare {{cog|sa|द्युम्न||splendor}}, {{cog|sa|द्युमत्||bright; an epithet of Indra}})<ref>{{R:fi:EVE|jumala|accessdate=2024-01-01}}</ref> or earlier {{der|fi|ine}}. Cognates include {{cog|et|jumal||god}} and {{cog|myv|ёндол||lightning}} (initial component).

